* D1 dendritic neuron (gf180mcuD, 3.3 V devices): axon-hillock soma + 2 dendritic subunits.
* Requires (include first): neuron/membrane.spice, neuron/lif.spice, readout/readout.spice,
* neuron/synapse.spice, dendrite/dtrim.spice.
* Layout: layout/dendrite/ (dend_d1). Design notes: cells/dendrite/README.md.
*
* Topology (reference: model/reference.py Compartments.star(2) / chain(3), S = 100):
*   soma  = lif_ah (200 fF mcap, leak_ota_deg, det_ah + Cfb 8 fF, refrac): spike channel 13
*   d1,d2 = 200 fF mcap + leak_ota_deg (same leak as the soma)
*   axial coupling = bidirectional transconductor: two follower OTAs back to back (ax_pair),
*     I(a<-b) = Iax*tanh((Vb-Va)/VL), g_ax = 6.2 S/A * Iax (same g/Ib as the leak), VL ~ 155 mV
*     soma-d1 always on; d2 pair's far end switched to soma (star, chain=0) or d1 (chain=1)
*   plateau per subunit (dplat): all-or-none regenerative, enabled by pl_en, with a timer that
*     ends it after T_plat; re-arms when the subunit falls back below threshold.
*
* Config bits (regmap ANA[5:4] = PLATEAU_EN[1:0]; D2 does not exist on this chip):
*   pl_en  = PLATEAU_EN[0]: plateau nonlinearity on in both subunits (all-or-none, CS EXP-08)
*   chain  = PLATEAU_EN[1]: topology, 0 = depth-1 star (soma-d1, soma-d2), 1 = chain soma-d1-d2
*
* Probe taps (prb_nsf wf=4u lf=2u, like the array slots): sel0 = soma vm (PROBE_SUB 0),
*   sel1 = d2 (PROBE_SUB 1), sel2 = d1 (PROBE_SUB 2).
*
* Bias (all are gate lines from B1 masters, like the array):
*   el, vsrc, vreset, vbn_leak, vbp_st, vbn_ref, vbn_prb, en : shared with the neuron array
*   vbn_ax : NEW, axial coupling tail (nfet master W/L 2/4), Iax = g_ax / 6.2 S/A (645 pA = 4 nS)
*   Plateau strength, duration and Ep are fixed ratios of vbn_leak; the plateau threshold
*   detector shares vsrc (calibrated AH rail) and vbp_st with the soma's detector.

* --------------------------------------------------------------- ax_pair ---
* Axial conductance between x and y: two back-to-back follower OTAs (leak_ota_deg, membrane.spice;
* same devices incl. the 2026-11-19 headroom fix: inputs 4/1, degeneration diodes 8/1).
* I(into x) = Iax*tanh((Vy-Vx)/VL), and the mirror image into y: a symmetric conductance
* g_ax = 6.2 S/A * Iax for |Vx-Vy| < ~80 mV, saturating at +-Iax beyond ~150 mV.
* Hold: each OTA output reaches its compartment through a pfet switch (off while hold = 1), as the
* leak does through the synapse's XHL. The OTA keeps running as a follower, so on release its output
* sits at the far compartment's voltage (small kick); an off pfet leaks fA (a tail switch leaves the
* output pfet leaking pA into the node).
.subckt ax_ota_h out in vbn hold vdd vss
XMT  t   vbn vss vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=4u
XM1  a   in  s1  vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=1u
XD1  s1  s1  t   vss nfet_03v3 W=8u L=1u
XM2  o   o   s2  vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=1u
XD2  s2  s2  t   vss nfet_03v3 W=8u L=1u
XP1  a   a   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=2u L=4u
XP2  o   a   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=2u L=4u
XHO  out hold o  vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
.ends ax_ota_h
.subckt ax_pair x y vbn hold vdd vss
XA x y vbn hold vdd vss ax_ota_h
XB y x vbn hold vdd vss ax_ota_h
.ends ax_pair

* ------------------------------------------------------------------ pdet ---
* Plateau threshold detector: det_ah (lif.spice) without Cfb. Starved inverter on vd whose nfet
* source sits on vsrc (the per-die calibrated AH threshold rail), so the plateau threshold tracks
* the soma threshold; XNI is half the soma's W/L, which puts the trip ~20-25 mV above it
* (~EL + 100 mV). Output xb is full swing, high while vd is above threshold. ~10 nA at rest.
* Trim hook (nibble 7): dend_d1 port vsrcp feeds this rail for both subunits (tied to vsrc until
* the trim cell exists; the trim then supplies vsrc + offset). Trip moves ~1:1 with the rail.
.subckt pdet vd xb vsrc vbp_st vdd vss
XPS s   vbp_st vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=2u
XPI n1  vd  s   vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.5u
XNI n1  vd  vsrc vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=1u
XS2 s2  vbp_st vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=2u
XP2 p   n1  s2  vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XN2 p   n1  vsrc vss nfet_03v3 W=0.22u L=2u
* third stage pull-up starved from vbp_st (XS3), as det_ah since 2026-11-19: unstarved it crowbarred
* tens of uA into vsrc at every crossing (sim/tb/dendrite/tb_pdet_q.py). XN3 stays on vsrc.
XS3 s3  vbp_st vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=2u
XP3 pb  p   s3  vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XN3 pb  p   vsrc vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
* reset keeper (as det_ah's XK, 2026-11-19): with all biases off XS3 is off and pb would float, so the
* output inverter would crowbar and xb sit mid-rail; XK holds pb high while xb is low (sim/tb/dendrite/tb_doff.py)
XK  pb  xb  vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=0.22u L=1u
* XQ: weak unstarved pull-up on pb (gate p). The keeper alone does not set the state: at ss/0, ss/27 and sf/0 with
* biases off pb came up low, xb high, keeper off, and the output inverter drew 30-40 uA (tb_pdet_off.py, variant
* k1). With XQ: xb = 0 and Idd < 1 nA at all 15 corners for vd low (vd = 1.4 V: xb = 3.3 V, Idd <= 0.45 uA).
* Normal operation: trip +0.8 mV, vsrc charge per crossing +0.2 pC (tb_pdet_kq.py).
XQ  pb  p   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=0.22u L=4u
XON xb  pb  vss vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
XOP xb  pb  vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
* hysteresis: while xb is high a second input nfet helps pull n1 down, so the detector releases
* ~20 mV below its trip point (no re-trigger as the subunit decays through threshold)
XNH n1  vd  h   vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=1u
XNE h   xb  vsrc vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
.ends pdet

* ----------------------------------------------------------------- dplat ---
* Plateau nonlinearity of one subunit (vd): all-or-none, regenerative, finite duration.
*   detector pdet -> xb (high while vd > threshold).
*   timer: vt precharged to VDD while below threshold; discharged by Idur (= Ib_leak/2, W/L 1/4
*     vs the leak tail's 1/2) while above; T_plat ~ Ct*(3.3 V - ~1 V)/Idur ~ 0.7 ms at S = 100
*     (scales with the leak bias, i.e. with S).  Ct = 50 fF mcap.
*   plateau current: 5T follower OTA toward vep (Ep), tail Ipl ~ 8*Ib_leak (2 x W/L 2 vs 1/2) through
*     three series switches (L = 1 um: low off-leakage at ff/85 C); output to vd through the hold pfet XHP: xb (above threshold) AND vt (timer running) AND pl_en (config bit).
*   After the timer expires the plateau stays off until vd has fallen below threshold (re-arm).
.subckt dplat vd pl_en hold vep vsrc vbn_leak vbp_st vdd vss
XDT  vd  xb  vsrc vbp_st vdd vss pdet
* XTP long L (was 0.28): xb only reaches ~3.2 V at ff/85, and the short pfet's leakage then slowed the timer
* (plateau 2.3 ms / 27 spikes at ff/85; 1.6 ms / 17 with L = 2)
XTP  vt  xb  vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=2u
XTS  vt  xb  ti  vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XTI  ti  vbn_leak vss vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=4u
XCT  vt  vss mcap wl=3.54u
XOM1 oa  vep ot  vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=2u
XOM2 vo  vo  ot  vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=2u
XOP1 oa  oa  vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=2u L=4u
XOP2 vo  oa  vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=2u L=4u
XHP  vd  hold vo vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XS1  ot  xb  o1  vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=1u
XS2  o1  vt  o2  vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=1u
XS3  o2  pl_en o3 vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=1u
XOTA o3  vbn_leak vss vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=2u
XOTB o3  vbn_leak vss vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=2u
.ends dplat

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- vepgen ---
* Plateau reversal Ep, referenced to el: an nfet diode (W/L 4, source on el) carrying Ib_leak
* (pfet mirror). vep = el + Vgs ~ el + 0.74 V (tt 27 C; 0.52..0.92 V over corners/0-85 C).
* Only gates load vep; Ib_leak flows into el.
.subckt vepgen vep el vbn_leak vdd vss
XS  m   vbn_leak vss vss nfet_03v3 W=2u L=4u
XPD m   m   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=2u
XPM vep m   vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=2u
XN  vep vep el  vss nfet_03v3 W=4u L=1u
.ends vepgen

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- soma_h ---
* Soma = lif_ah (lif.spice) with its leak output vl reaching vm through a hold switch XHL (pfet, on
* while hold = 0, as the slot's syn_in does), and vr brought out for the membrane reset.
.subckt soma_h vm spk vr el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref hold vdd vss cfb=8f
XC  vm vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL  vl el vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_deg
XHL vm hold vl vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XD  vm spk vsrc vbp_st vdd vss det_ah cfb={cfb}
XR  spk vm vr vreset vbn_ref vdd vss refrac
.ends soma_h

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- bsteer ---
* Stim B steering (D1_BSEL, regmap ANA[7]): bsel = 0 -> B into d1's synapse (b1, clustered with A);
* bsel = 1 -> B into d2's synapse (b2, distributed). Transmission gates + pull-downs on the unused side.
.subckt bsteer stb bsel b1 b2 vdd vss
XI   bsel bselb vdd vss inv3
XN1  b1 bselb stb vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
XP1  b1 bsel  stb vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XD1  b1 bsel  vss vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
XN2  b2 bsel  stb vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
XP2  b2 bselb stb vdd pfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XD2  b2 bselb vss vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
.ends bsteer

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- dend_d1 ---
* Ports:
*   vs d1 d2       soma / subunit nodes (test nodes; inputs come through the synapses)
*   spk            soma spike (spike channel 13)
*   sel0 sel1 sel2 probe lines: soma (SUB 0), d2 (SUB 1), d1 (SUB 2)
*   pl_en chain    PLATEAU_EN[0], PLATEAU_EN[1] (0 = star, 1 = chain)
*   d1_bsel        ANA[7]: 0 = stim B into d1 (clustered with A), 1 = stim B into d2 (distributed)
*   sta stb hold mreset  rt_out[0..3] (stim A, stim B, hold, membrane reset), 3.3 V logic
*   vbp_syn        synapse weight line (p-IDAC; shared by both synapses)
*   ta0..3 tb0..3  gap-trim bits, TRIM nibble 7 (d1 plateau threshold) and nibble 8 (d2); code 0 = -44 mV
*   el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb en abus : shared array lines
*   vsrcp          plateau-detector source rail: tie to vsrc
*   vbn_ax         axial coupling bias (new n-IDAC line)
.subckt dend_d1 vs d1 d2 spk sel0 sel1 sel2 pl_en chain d1_bsel sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn
+ ta0 ta1 ta2 ta3 tb0 tb1 tb2 tb3 el vsrc vsrcp vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref
+ vbn_prb vbn_ax en abus vdd vss cfb=8f wf=4u lf=2u
* soma: axon-hillock LIF with hold switch; mreset pulls its refractory node up (as syn_in does)
XS   vs spk vr el vsrc vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref hold vdd vss soma_h cfb={cfb}
XMR  vdd mreset vr vss nfet_03v3 W=0.5u L=0.28u
* subunits: cap, leak (output dl through the synapse's hold switch), synapse, gap trim. The trim
* injects into dl, not into the membrane, so hold (dl cut off) also stops the trim current.
XC1  d1 vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL1  dl1 el la1 vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_dega
XY1  d1 dl1 vss sta b1 hold vss vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
XC2  d2 vss mcap wl=7.07u
XL2  dl2 el la2 vbn_leak vdd vss leak_ota_dega
XY2  d2 dl2 vss b2 vss hold vss vbp_syn vdd vss syn_in
XB   stb d1_bsel b1 b2 vdd vss bsteer
* axial coupling (outputs disconnected during hold)
XA1  vs d1 vbn_ax hold vdd vss ax_pair
* d2's link: its far end y2 is switched to the soma (star) or to d1 (chain). y2 is both the input
* of the OTA driving d2 and the output of the OTA driving y2, so two switches retarget the pair.
XI   chain chainb vdd vss inv3
XA2  d2 y2 vbn_ax hold vdd vss ax_pair
XWS  y2 chainb vs vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
XWC  y2 chain  d1 vss nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u
* plateau
XEP  vep el vbn_leak vdd vss vepgen
XP1  d1 pl_en hold vep vsrcp vbn_leak vbp_st vdd vss dplat
XP2  d2 pl_en hold vep vsrcp vbn_leak vbp_st vdd vss dplat
* probe taps
XT0  vs abus en sel0 vbn_prb vdd vss prb_nsf wf={wf} lf={lf}
XT1  d2 abus en sel1 vbn_prb vdd vss prb_nsf wf={wf} lf={lf}
XT2  d1 abus en sel2 vbn_prb vdd vss prb_nsf wf={wf} lf={lf}
* plateau-threshold gap trims (trim_gap4w, dtrim.spice): d1 nibble 7 (ta), d2 nibble 8 (tb). They inject
* into the leak output dl (not the membrane), so hold also stops them. Drawn in the layout's former keep-outs.
XR1  la1 dl1 vbn_leak ta0 ta1 ta2 ta3 vdd vss trim_gap4w
XR2  la2 dl2 vbn_leak tb0 tb1 tb2 tb3 vdd vss trim_gap4w
.ends dend_d1

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- dend_d1t ---
* Former wrapper (trims outside dend_d1); kept as an alias so old decks still run. Same ports as dend_d1.
.subckt dend_d1t vs d1 d2 spk sel0 sel1 sel2 pl_en chain d1_bsel sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn
+ ta0 ta1 ta2 ta3 tb0 tb1 tb2 tb3 el vsrc vsrcp vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref
+ vbn_prb vbn_ax en abus vdd vss
XD   vs d1 d2 spk sel0 sel1 sel2 pl_en chain d1_bsel sta stb hold mreset vbp_syn
+ ta0 ta1 ta2 ta3 tb0 tb1 tb2 tb3 el vsrc vsrcp vreset vbn_leak vbp_st vbn_ref vbn_prb vbn_ax en abus vdd vss dend_d1
.ends dend_d1t
